WEBVTT

00:26:58.663 --> 00:27:01.204
you you wrote about this topic at length

00:27:01.204 --> 00:27:04.871
and what some have called your magnum opus
, thinking fast and slow.

00:27:05.704 --> 00:27:09.538
I'm wondering what you've rethought
since you published that book.

00:27:11.204 --> 00:27:16.121
Well, um. You know, there
were there were things

00:27:16.121 --> 00:27:17.913
I published in that book that were wrong.

00:27:18.288 --> 00:27:21.288
I mean, you know, literature I
quoted that didn't hold up.

00:27:21.913 --> 00:27:25.871
Now, the interesting thing
about that is that

00:27:26.538 --> 00:27:29.121
I haven't changed my mind
about much of anything.

00:27:29.913 --> 00:27:34.163
But that is because changing your mind
is really quite difficult. That is